{"nodes": [{"id": "src_public_logoibpulse", "label": "Logoibpulse.webp", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "src/public/Logoibpulse.webp", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "src_public_logoibpulse_ibpulse_brand", "label": "ibPulse brand name", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/public/Logoibpulse.webp", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "src_public_logoibpulse_eye_emblem", "label": "Eye emblem (red swooshes around grey sphere pupil)", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "src/public/Logoibpulse.webp", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "src_public_logoibpulse_ibpulse_wordmark", "label": "ibPulse wordmark (bold black sans-serif, red square i-dot)", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "src/public/Logoibpulse.webp", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "src_public_logoibpulse_red_black_grey_palette", "label": "Red, black and grey palette", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/public/Logoibpulse.webp", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "src_public_logoibpulse_watchful_eye_metaphor", "label": "Watchful eye metaphor", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "src/public/Logoibpulse.webp", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The emblem reads as a stylized eye: two opposed red swooshes form the lids around a transparent gap, and a grey metallic sphere acts as iris and pupil. For a project tracker (ibPulse by IBSYSTEMS.SRL) this most likely conveys watching over project status. This intent is inferred from the artwork and product context; the image does not state it."}, {"id": "src_public_logoibpulse_logo_transparent_padding", "label": "Logo transparent padding (cropped via object-cover)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "src/public/Logoibpulse.webp", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The 2000x1090 canvas is mostly transparent: the artwork occupies only x 84-1858 and y 356-711, about 33% of the canvas height. RootLayout (md:hidden mobile header, h-8), Sidebar (h-12) and the landing Navbar (h-20) place the image in fixed-height boxes with object-cover, which crops the empty vertical margin so the lockup fills the box. SplashScreen (object-contain) and the landing Footer (h-10 w-auto) render the whole canvas, padding included, so the Footer artwork renders small. The cropping intent is inferred from the classes. Replacing the asset with a tightly cropped logo would make object-cover clip the sides of the lockup in those boxes."}, {"id": "src_public_logoibpulse_logo_css_filter_treatments", "label": "Logo CSS filter treatments (dark:brightness-200, invert)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "src/public/Logoibpulse.webp", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The logo is a single transparent-background WebP whose wordmark is pure black (rgb 0,0,0 at alpha 255), so it would vanish on dark surfaces. Components adapt this one asset with Tailwind filters instead of loading a per-theme asset: the RootLayout mobile header and the Sidebar header use dark:brightness-200, and SplashScreen stacks an invert copy with an animate-pulse copy. The dark-mode intent is inferred from the dark: prefixes. Caveat: brightness() scales RGB, so it brightens the red and grey emblem but cannot lighten the pure black wordmark. The purpose of the inverted duplicate in SplashScreen is unclear because its container is bg-white and not theme-aware."}], "edges": [{"source": "src_public_logoibpulse", "target": "src_public_logoibpulse_ibpulse_brand", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/public/Logoibpulse.webp", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "src_public_logoibpulse", "target": "src_public_logoibpulse_eye_emblem", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/public/Logoibpulse.webp", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "src_public_logoibpulse", "target": "src_public_logoibpulse_ibpulse_wordmark", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/public/Logoibpulse.webp", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "src_public_logoibpulse", "target": "src_public_logoibpulse_red_black_grey_palette", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/public/Logoibpulse.webp", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "src_public_logoibpulse_ibpulse_wordmark", "target": "src_public_logoibpulse_ibpulse_brand", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/public/Logoibpulse.webp", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "src_public_logoibpulse_watchful_eye_metaphor", "target": "src_public_logoibpulse_eye_emblem", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.75, "source_file": "src/public/Logoibpulse.webp", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "src_public_logoibpulse_logo_transparent_padding", "target": "src_public_logoibpulse", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/public/Logoibpulse.webp", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "src_public_logoibpulse_logo_transparent_padding", "target": "src_layouts_rootlayout", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_